    "prompt": "A dense modern waterfront city on a subtropical bay: a high-rise downtown of glass towers standing over continuous mid-rise blocks on a street grid, split from its sister quarter by a river running down to the bay, with road bridges joining the two. A working harbour with piers and moored ships on the bayfront, a small city airport inland with aircraft on the apron, a leafy row-house quarter up the shore, and a palm-fringed waterfront park between the towers and the water. Streets with sidewalks, streetlights and crossings everywhere; the city should read full of life from any rooftop.",
